===Etymology 2===
{{rfi|en}}
{{wikispecies|Satureja}}
From {{inh|en|enm|saverey}}, possibly from {{der|en|ang|sæþerie}}, from {{der|en|la|satureia}}, influenced by or via {{etyl|fro|en}} {{m|fro|savereie}}.

====Noun====
{{en-noun|~|savories}}

# Any of several [[Mediterranean]] [[herb]]s, of the genus ''{{ll|mul|Satureja}}'', grown as [[culinary]] [[flavouring]]s.
# The leaves of these plants used as a flavouring.

=====Derived terms=====
* {{l|en|summer savory}} (''{{ll|mul|Satureja hortensis}}'')
